[thin] Existing rod-register section, outside the tube-port geometry change: its rod-clearance bore and 2 mm radial wall retain the rod register and the float-stop interface. The tube-grip implementation does not qualify its strength or lifetime.
alternatives: Thickening the register changes an existing float-stop interface and needs its own fit review; this task retains the rod and float datums.
