[ledge] This small land is the perimeter lip meeting the lower annular face of the flush air spool at the plate underside, z=5.000. It is coplanar with the TPU face. The cutting tool stops at that plane so no recessed 0.1 mm shelf remains.
alternatives: Cutting below the plate underside recesses this mating land; cutting the lip to the rim alters the gasket-side wall. Moving the air axis changes the reviewed casing passage and equipment clearances.
